Derived files:
  library/tokens/openbridge-tokens.json   design tokens and type styles extracted from
                                          src/palettes/variables.css and src/mixins/fonts.css
  library/icons/*.json                    icon geometry converted from src/icons/icon-*.ts
  build/*/.../stylesheet/stylesheet.css   generated from the token file
  build/*/.../script-python/cadre/icons   generated from the icon files

Changes: values were extracted and reformatted (JSON, Perspective stylesheet classes, ia.shapes.svg
element lists); circles, rectangles, lines and polygons were rewritten as SVG path data.

